# M6 Lesson Layout & Spacing

Apply to all four lessons under `.repo/fullstack-mastery-module-6-form-mastery-rhf-zod/` (`0`–`3`).

## Spacing tokens (only these)

| Token | Use |
|-------|-----|
| **`p-3`** | **Only** on `<main>` in `App.tsx` — sole outer page padding |
| **`gap-3`** | Between **structural blocks** inside a functional area (form fields, button row, list of cards, avatar ↔ text column) |
| **`h-3`** | Small vertical spacer: lesson title → description (`App.tsx`) |
| **`h-6`** | Large vertical spacer: description → lesson content; **form block → registry block** |
| **`mt-3`** | Section margin when a spacer div is awkward (e.g. stepper after header) |

Do **not** use `gap-1/2/4`, `p-6`, `mb-*`, `pt-2`, `py-2`, or extra padding in `globals.css` on `main`.

## Functional blocks

- **Block A — form**: inputs + submit/actions. **No Card** wrapper on the form.
- **Block B — registry**: “Created users/invoices” heading + list. Separated from Block A by `<div className="h-6" />`.
- **Within Block B**: heading → items use `gap-3` only (same functional block).

## Text stack (no gap)

Multiple `Typography` lines that read as one unit (title + subtitle, User #id + name) → `flex flex-col` **without** `gap-*`.

Label + value pairs in summary rows (`UserFieldRow`) → no gap; use `sm:flex-row sm:justify-between`.

## Card usage

| Area | Card? |
|------|-------|
| Form / wizard / customer field | **No** |
| L3 line item row (description, qty, price, actions) | **Yes** — `Card p-3` per row (`LineItemRow`) |
| L2/L3 created user/invoice entries | **Yes** — `Card p-3` per entry (`UserCard` / `InvoiceCard`) |
| Registry skeleton placeholders | **Yes** — match loaded card shape |

## Registry list (L0/L1 ListBox)

- `ListBox`: `className="gap-3 p-0"`
- `ListBox.Item`: `className="p-0"` — spacing between users is `gap-3` on the list, not item padding.

## App.tsx shell (all lessons)

```tsx
<main className="min-h-screen bg-background p-3">
  <div className="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
    <Typography.Heading … />
    <div className="h-3" />
    <Typography.Paragraph … />
    <div className="h-6" />
    {content}
  </div>
</main>
```

## Form client pattern

```tsx
<div className="flex flex-col">
  <form className="flex flex-col gap-3">…</form>
  <div className="h-6" />
  <UserRegistry … />
</div>
```

## L1 async availability

Do not render a placeholder `<p>` when `idle` — it reserves height and pushes the button down. Render `#availability` only when state is `checking | available | taken`.
